---
// 나무 책상 — 모든 페이지의 바탕. 종이(PaperStack 또는 단일 종이)는 slot 으로 받는다.
import '../styles/global.css';
import Sheet from '../components/Sheet.astro';
import Sprite from '../components/Sprite.astro';
import profile from '../../config/profile.mjs';
import { url } from '../lib/site';

interface Props {
  title?: string;
  description?: string;
  /** 검색 엔진 색인 제외 */
  noindex?: boolean;
}

const { title, description = profile.intro, noindex = false } = Astro.props;
const pageTitle = title ? `${title} · ${profile.siteTitle}` : profile.siteTitle;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    {noindex && <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />}
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#5e3d24" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={pageTitle} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={url('/favicon.svg')} />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <script is:inline>
      try {
        if (localStorage.getItem('motion') === 'on') document.documentElement.dataset.motion = 'on';
      } catch {}
    </script>
  </head>
  <body class="desk">
    <header class="nameplate">
      <a class="plate" href={url('/')}>
        <span class="plate-title">{profile.siteTitle}</span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <div class="decor decor-mug" aria-hidden="true"><Sprite name="mug" scale={6} /></div>
    <div class="decor decor-plant" aria-hidden="true"><Sprite name="plant" scale={6} /></div>
    <div class="decor decor-pad" aria-hidden="true"><Sprite name="controller" scale={6} /></div>
    <p class="decor decor-note" aria-hidden="true">오늘도<br />한 줄 쓰기!</p>

    <main class="desk-main">
      <slot />
    </main>
    <Sheet />

    <footer class="desk-footer">
      {profile.email && <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a>}
      {profile.phone && <a href={`tel:${profile.phone.replaceAll('-', '')}`}>{profile.phone}</a>}
      <button class="motion-toggle" type="button" data-motion-toggle hidden>애니메이션 켜기</button>
    </footer>

    <script>
      import { prefersReducedMotion, motionForced, setMotionForced } from '../lib/motion';

      // 움직임 줄이기를 켠 컴퓨터에서만 보인다
      const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-motion-toggle]');
      if (button && prefersReducedMotion()) {
        const sync = () => {
          button.textContent = motionForced() ? '애니메이션 끄기' : '애니메이션 켜기';
          button.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(motionForced()));
        };
        sync();
        button.hidden = false;
        button.addEventListener('click', () => {
          setMotionForced(!motionForced());
          sync();
        });
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
